@host = https://localhost:7406

### Listar todos
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Uno por id
GET {{host}}/api/products/3

### Uno que no existe (404)
GET {{host}}/api/products/999

### Buscar por nombre
GET {{host}}/api/products/search?name=tecla

### Buscar sin coincidencias (200 con lista vacía)
GET {{host}}/api/products/search?name=zzz

### Buscar sin texto (400)
GET {{host}}/api/products/search?name=

### Estadísticas
GET {{host}}/api/products/stats

### Crear uno válido (201)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Parlantes",
  "price": 12000
}

### Crear con datos inválidos (400)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -100
}

### Crear con nombre repetido (409)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Webcam HD",
  "price": 100
}

### Actualizar (204)
PUT {{host}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mouse gamer",
  "price": 4500
}

### Actualizar uno que no existe (404)
PUT {{host}}/api/products/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Otro",
  "price": 50
}

### Eliminar (204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/2

### Eliminar el mismo otra vez (404)
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/2
